<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-panama"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Panama.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Panama</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Omar Torrijos and Jimmy Carter sign the canal treaties</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/czechoslovakia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Czechoslovakia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Czechoslovakia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Dissidents publish the Charter 77 declaration</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/tanzania"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Tanzania.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Tanzania</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">TANU and the Afro-Shirazi Party merge as Chama Cha Mapinduzi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/islamic-republic-of-pakistan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Islamic%20Republic%20of%20Pakistan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Islamic Republic of Pakistan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A military coup against Zulfikar Ali Bhutto's Pakistan Peoples Party ends democracy; General Zia-ul-Haq becomes president in 1978 and Islamises law and the economy.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/derg"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Derg.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Derg</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 3 February Chairman Tafari Benti is killed in a shootout and Mengistu takes power; Vice-Chairman Atnafu Abate is executed with 40 officers on 13 November; Somalia invades the Ogaden.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/barcelona"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Barcelona.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Barcelona</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">More than a million people demonstrate for the restoration of Catalan autonomy, which is granted within a month</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/journey-to-the-west"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Journey%20to%20the%20West.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Journey to the West</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Anthony C. Yu begins publishing the first complete English translation to render the poems and songs, finished in 1983</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/black-consciousness-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Black%20Consciousness%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Black Consciousness Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Steve Biko dies in police custody on 12 September</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/black-consciousness-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Black%20Consciousness%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Black Consciousness Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 19 October, known as Black Wednesday, 19 groups associated with the movement are declared illegal</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/utilitarianism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Utilitarianism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Utilitarianism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">John Harsanyi proposes preference utilitarianism in Morality and the Theory of Rational Behaviour</span></li></ul></section>
